'A fresh independent task supplies C=20+0.8(1−0.25)Y, M=0.1Y and Y=C+I+G−M with the same government and private autonomous impulses. The learner derives a multiplier of 2 and net change of 16 and explains the tax and import leakages rather than subtracting displacement only after multiplication.',
